---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Identity | Sovrin Group" section="solutions">
  <div class="dark-zone page-dark">
  <section class="hero-page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Solutions · Identity</p>
      <h1>Identity is the Invariant Operator</h1>
      <p class="lede">It's the invariant everything else must inherit from.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Identity is not a profile, a record, or a permission set. It is the
        source of truth that determines how systems behave, how decisions are
        made, and how alignment is maintained over time. It is the fixed
        structure that gives a system its shape, its boundaries, and its truth.
      </p>
      <p>
        When identity is defined correctly, reasoning, governance,
        continuity, and alignment all become enforceable. When it isn't,
        nothing can hold.
      </p>
      <p>
        Identity is the foundation of every system we build. It is a constant
        that does not drift, does not reinterpret itself, and does not collapse
        under pressure.
      </p>
      <h2>Identity is the substrate. Identity is the operator. Identity is the theorem.</h2>
      <p>Everything else is the proof.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a class="btn" href="/resources/whitepapers/">Read the Research</a>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/solutions/">Back to Solutions</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</Base>
